          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A retry from History is sent to Groq, since Apple can't transcribe a saved recording." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › Privacy & Data › What leaves this Mac › Your voice: second sentence when Apple Dictation is in use and a Groq key is stored. Groq is a company name.",
      "localizations" : {
