    "Add the names and terms SpeechText gets wrong — a colleague's name, your product, a code identifier — and how they come out instead. They're put right after every dictation." : {
      "comment" : "Dictionary page: shown under 'No words yet.' when the list of words is empty. SpeechText is the app's name.",
      "localizations" : {
