            "value" : "Уже підключаюся, до зустрічі."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Just %@ — that's it" : {
      "comment" : "Setup window, Try it step: title when the user holds only the letter key. %@ is that key, e.g. Q.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
