    "Nothing was changed. Try again — or double-press to edit without an instruction." : {
      "comment" : "Notice beside the dictation overlay: text under the title. Edit Selection with AI (rewrites the text selected in another app): 'double-press' means pressing the shortcut twice.",
      "localizations" : {
