            "value" : "Часто виходить як"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Old maps were confident about coastlines and vague about interiors, which is roughly how most of us describe our own plans." : {
      "comment" : "Usage page, typing test: a sentence to type. Write a natural sentence of about the same length in your language; it is only for timing the typing.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los mapas antiguos eran seguros con las costas y vagos con el interior, más o menos como describimos casi todos nuestros propios planes."
          }
