    "Optional. Press %@ instead of %@ and AI turns what you say — or what you ask for — into clean text for the app you're in." : {
      "comment" : "Setup window, AI step. The first %@ is the AI shortcut, the second the dictation shortcut, both shown as keys.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Optional. Press %1$@ instead of %2$@ and AI turns what you say — or what you ask for — into clean text for the app you're in."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opcional. Pulsa %1$@ en lugar de %2$@ y la IA convierte lo que dices, o lo que pides, en texto limpio para la app en la que estás."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Необов'язково. Натисніть %1$@ замість %2$@ — і ШІ перетворить сказане на чистий текст для вашої програми."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. Turns a dictation into finished text — an email, a list, a translation — or does what you ask (“a short reply, in English”)." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › AI Rewrite: line under the page title.",
      "localizations" : {
