    "Press %@ and let go — it records with nothing held. Press %@ again to paste." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › Dictation › Recording › Press to start, again to paste: gesture text. Both %@ are the shortcut, e.g. ⌃⇧Q.",
      "localizations" : {
