      }
    },
    "The card at the top of Home that plays each shortcut — Dictate, AI Rewrite and Edit." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › Appearance › Main window › Shortcut card on Home: row text. Dictate, AI Rewrite and Edit are the shortcuts' names.",
