    "With the Replacements, in what every engine writes before it's pasted or rewritten, in AI Rewrite's and Edit's replies, and in History." : {
      "comment" : "Dictionary page, What a word does: row text. Replacements is the section of this page; AI Rewrite and Edit are features of the app; History is a page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
